  Protein query and reference sequences for batched Smith-Waterman
  alignment, and the expected alignment results.

Source:
  https://github.com/mgawan/ADEPT, test-data/: the two FASTA files are
  byte-identical at upstream commit 4f17274dc98b (checked 2026-11-19).
  result_aa is not in ADEPT; it is the expected output that HeCBench's
  regression check compares against.

